<%- include('../partials/shell-top', { title: '用户与权限', active: 'admin', user: user }) %>

<div class="page-head">
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">仅管理员可见</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">用户与权限</h1>
    <p class="page-sub"><%= users.length %> 位成员 · 权限改动在下一个请求生效</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="banner">
  <span class="banner-icon"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-shield" /></svg></span>
  <div>
    <h3>守卫检查权限，而不是角色名</h3>
    <p>
      角色只是默认权限的模板，真正生效的是 <code>can_view_all_applications</code> 与
      <code>can_manage_users</code> 两个布尔字段。撤销「管理用户」后，该账号下一次请求就会被挡在
      <code>/admin/users</code> 之外。
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="user-panel">
  <div class="user-head">
    <span>用户</span>
    <span>角色</span>
    <span>查看全部投递</span>
    <span>管理用户</span>
  </div>

  <% users.forEach(function (u) { %>
  <div class="user-row">
    <div class="user-cell">
      <span class="avatar" style="background: <%= u.tint %>; color: <%= u.tintInk %>"><%= u.initial %></span>
      <span style="min-width: 0">
        <span class="user-name"><%= u.username %></span>
        <% if (u.self) { %><span class="role-tag" style="margin-left: 6px">你</span><% } %>
        <br />
        <span class="user-mail"><%= u.email %></span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="cell">
      <span class="cell-label">角色</span>
      <button class="role-select" type="button">
        <%= u.roleLabel %>
        <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chevron" /></svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="cell">
      <span class="cell-label">查看全部投递</span>
      <label class="switch">
        <input type="checkbox" <%= u.canViewAll ? 'checked' : '' %> aria-label="查看全部投递" />
        <span class="switch-track"></span>
        <span class="switch-label"><%= u.canViewAll ? '允许' : '关闭' %></span>
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="cell">
      <span class="cell-label">管理用户</span>
      <label class="switch">
        <input type="checkbox" <%= u.canManageUsers ? 'checked' : '' %> aria-label="管理用户" />
        <span class="switch-track"></span>
        <span class="switch-label"><%= u.canManageUsers ? '允许' : '关闭' %></span>
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <% }); %>

  <div class="user-foot">
    <p>权限变更立即写入数据库，已在线的会话下一次请求生效。</p>
    <button class="btn-jt" type="button">
      <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check" /></svg>
      保存更改
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/shell-bottom', { active: 'admin', tabbar: false }) %>
